# The settings page, which stands in for everything below the main window's title bar.
# Each page in place, then the folders restored. Run it again with --size 900x480 to see a page
# taller than the window scroll.

settings general
shot 01-general
settings appearance
shot 02-appearance
settings preview
shot 03-preview
settings search-index
shot 04-search-index
settings history
shot 05-history
settings new-items
shot 06-new-items
settings columns
shot 07-columns
settings saved-searches
shot 07a-saved-searches
settings workspaces
shot 07b-workspaces
settings context-menu
shot 08-context-menu
settings command-bars
shot 08b-menus-and-toolbars
settings keyboard
shot 08a-keyboard
settings close
shot 09-back-to-folders

# --- Live apply. There is no Save: a box ticked on the page reaches the folders once the page's
# debounce has run, and leaving straight after a change still writes it (the flush on close). ---

tree .
refresh
assert-no-row .hidden-notes.txt
settings general
settings tick Show hidden items on
settle 800
settings close
assert-row .hidden-notes.txt

settings general
settings tick Show hidden items off
settings close
assert-no-row .hidden-notes.txt

# --- New items: the types the New submenu offers, edited in place and written as they change; an
# import adds what Windows offers (a fixed list in a run) without disturbing what is there. ---

settings new-items
press NewTypeAdd
# A type with no name holds the whole list unwritten, and the strip over the page says why until it is fixed.
field-type NewTypeName
assert-visible SettingsProblem
shot 10a-new-items-problem
field-type NewTypeName Recipe card
assert-hidden SettingsProblem
field-type NewTypeExtension .recipe
press NewTypeImport
settle 500
shot 10-new-items
settings close
select notes.txt
menu files 11-menu-new-types
assert-menu-item Recipe card

# Leaving with a type that has no name asks first; Cancel stays, Leave drops the unsaved entry.
live-dialogs on
settings new-items
press NewTypeAdd
field-type NewTypeName
window-key Esc
assert-visible SettingsLeaveConfirm
shot 11a-leave-anyway
press SettingsLeaveCancel
assert-hidden SettingsLeaveConfirm
assert-visible SettingsProblem
window-key Esc
press SettingsLeaveConfirm
assert-hidden SettingsLayer
live-dialogs off
menu files
assert-menu-item Recipe card
assert-menu-item Rich Text Document
assert-menu-item Bitmap image
deselect
